+- A turn whose rounds report nothing at all still reports no usage ([validated by: still reports no usage when no round of the turn reports any](../../src/orchestration/afterModelResponseUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L91)).
+- A turn that ran no tools reports what the provider reported, unchanged, so the common path does not move ([validated by: receives collected response text and usage](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L236)).
+
